  <text decls="#source_1">
    <body>
      <div type="illustration" facs="#zone_picture">
        <figure xml:id="figure_1" ana="#dance"><desc>A woman in a flounced, patterned dress dancing with a fan, guitar players and dancers behind her; at the right a grand piano projecting beyond the frame of the picture</desc></figure>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_headline">
        <head><hi rendition="#i #in"><lb/>Rhythmic Beat of a Gaucho Dance
          <lb/>—When <seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#phantom_body" type="topic" resp="#claude">Phantom Fingers Play</seg></hi></head>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_text">
        <p><lb/><hi rendition="#dropcap">W</hi>ATCH <seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#phantom_body" type="topic" resp="#claude">the keys of your piano moving, though no one
          <lb/>sits before it!</seg> With every move comes forth the
          <lb/>pulsating rhythm of a colorful tango—beautiful
          <lb/>melody, strongly accented, native of the vast pampas
          <lb/>south of the Amazon. So strongly suggestive is the
          <lb/>music, <seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#dance" type="topic" resp="#claude">you see the bronzed Gaucho and his gorgeous belle
          <lb/>gracefully dancing</seg>. But who is playing with such wonderful
          <lb/>finesse? <seg xml:id="topic_4" ana="#exact_reproduction" type="topic" resp="#claude">It is one of the great artists of the pianoforte, whose
          <lb/>playing actually produced the movement of the keys just as
          <lb/>you see them</seg>. <seg xml:id="topic_5" ana="#miracle" type="topic" resp="#claude">The <name type="brand">Mason &amp; Risch Welte-Mignon</name> has
          <lb/>wrought this miracle</seg>. <seg xml:id="topic_6" ana="#touch_of_a_button" type="topic" resp="#claude">It has put at your command the
          <lb/>genius of all the famous concert pianists</seg>. Your choice of any
          <lb/>selection through the whole range of musical composition will
          <lb/>be perfectly rendered by your favorite pianist <seg xml:id="topic_7" ana="#virtual_presence" type="topic" resp="#claude">just as if he
          <lb/>favored you personally</seg>.</p>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_invitation">
        <p><lb/>We will gladly have the Masters play your favorite selections
          <lb/>for you any time you visit our show rooms.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="illustration" facs="#zone_vignette">
        <figure xml:id="figure_2" ana="#phantom_body"><desc>Two hands playing a piano keyboard, emerging from a dark vignette</desc></figure>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_caption">
        <ab><hi rendition="#i #smaller"><lb/>These are the <seg xml:id="topic_8" ana="#phantom_body" type="topic" resp="#claude">Phantom
          <lb/>Hands</seg> of a thousand
          <lb/><seg xml:id="topic_9" ana="#immortality" type="topic" resp="#claude">immortal pianists, their
          <lb/>genius preserved forever</seg>
          <lb/><seg xml:id="topic_10" ana="#miracle" type="topic" resp="#claude">through the miracle of
          <lb/><name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name> reproduc-
          <lb/>tion</seg>.</hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_address">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c #b"><lb/><address><addrLine><app>
            <rdg source="#source_1">248 DUNDAS STREET, LONDON.</rdg>
            <rdg source="#source_2">248 DUNDAS STREET LONDON</rdg>
          </app></addrLine></address></hi></ab>
      </div>
